\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20250629110320&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Gain_Extra_Damage_Auto_Attack_099693.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+4% of your Axe Fighting as extra damage for auto-attacks</div></div></div>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_block weapon_proficiency_border\"><div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Auto-Attack Critical Hit Chance\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+1% critical hit chance for auto-attacks</div></div>\n<div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_icon\" title=\"Life Gain on Kill\">\n<div></div>\n<div><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250625211543&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_Border_Active_417a88.png\"/></div>\n<div class=\"img32\"><img alt=\"32?cb=20251104183605&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Weapon_Proficiency_General_ed04f0.png\"/></div>\n</div><div class=\"weapon_proficiency_text weapon_proficiency_border\">+5 hit points on kill</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>With the spring patch 2012 the sprite of Barbarian Axe changed from <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Barbarian Axe (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barbarian_Axe_Old_5860aa.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> to <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Barbarian Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Barbarian_Axe_c29337.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span>.<br/>\nFrom Christmas Update 2007 until Summer Update 2017, it could be transformed into the following Enchanted Weapons through the process known as Enchanting:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Icy Barbarian Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Icy_Barbarian_Axe_711bf3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Icy Barbarian Axe</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Barbarian Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Barbarian_Axe_ece5c1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Earth Barbarian Axe</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Energy Barbarian Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Energy_Barbarian_Axe_18e98a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Energy Barbarian Axe</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Fiery Barbarian Axe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fiery_Barbarian_Axe_36cf88.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Fiery Barbarian Axe</li></ul>\n<p>These sprites are now used for their respective replicas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<